    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d524">

                <pb facs="0833" n="815" sameAs="frus:frus1947v03/pg815"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">851.51/12–1447: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Caffery</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-12-14T13:00:00+01:00">December 14,
                            1947—1 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>5379. As soon as Schuman heard of the decision to grant an advance of 150 million
                    dollars for immediate aid, he asked me to express his high appreciation thereof
                    to the Department.</p>
                <p>Sent Department as 5379, repeated USDel London as 985.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Caffery</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
